<title>UK: UK police close M5 motorway after bomb alert.</title>
<headline>UK police close M5 motorway after bomb alert.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Police closed a stretch of the M5 motorway in Gloucestershire, western England, on Tuesday afternoon following a security alert.</p>
<p>The incident came after a spate of bomb alerts earlier in the day closed motorways and airports in southern England. -- London Newsroom +44-171-542-7947</p>
